ES:
{{TAG:0003:0016:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}¡Corea del Sur!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0005:}}¡Gukbap, bibimbap!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Mi memoria ha vuelto de pronto!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}¡Me dirigía a Corea del Sur!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Eso es! ¡Ahora sí lo recuerdo!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Gracias! ¡Nunca lo olvidaré!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Me has hecho un gran favor!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0016:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}} La Corea del Sud!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0005:}}Certo! Evvai!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Mi si è accesa una lampadina
appena me l'hai detto!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Ecco dov'ero diretto!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Sì! Adesso ricordo!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Grazie per avermi fatto tornare
la memoria!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Senza di te non so
cosa avrei fatto!

.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0016:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}} Singapore!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0005:}}Evviva!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Era quello il nome del paese!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Grazie mille! Ora posso fiondarmi
lì di corsa senza paura di perdermi!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Non vedo l'ora di dare una bella
stretta di mano al Merlion!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
Te lo saluto io, non ti preoccupare!

EN:
.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0016:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}Belgium!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0003:}}My memory's back!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
That's the place!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} The country!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:002B:}}I was about to go to Belgium and
get some of that famous Belgian
chocolate for a snack!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}You've been a big help!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Thank you very much!

.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0000:0002:6400}}{{TAG:0003:0016:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}Japan!{{TAG:0000:0002:6400}}{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0000:0002:6400}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}That's it!{{TAG:0000:0002:6400}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} That's it!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I was headed to Japan!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}You're really amazing!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:000B:}}Perhaps you
have a link to the past with that
country or something?
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Anyway,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} thanks to you, I feel like
the sea fog has lifted from my head!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Thank you so very much!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I'll head off to Japan to experience
some of everything! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}But not
wasabi. That stuff's HOT!

IT:
.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0000:0002:6400}}{{TAG:0003:0016:}}{{TAG:0000:0002:6400}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}} Irlanda!{{TAG:0000:0002:6400}}{{TAG:0000:0002:6400}}{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0005:}}Ecco dov'ero diretto!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Risposta esattaaa!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Meno male che ci sei tu!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:0004:}}
Stavo andando lì a raccogliere
un po' di trifogli!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Speriamo di trovare anche un paio
di quadrifogli: dicono che portino
fortuna!

.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0000:0002:6400}}{{TAG:0003:0016:}}{{TAG:0000:0002:6400}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}} Ma certo, in Canada!{{TAG:0000:0002:6400}}{{TAG:0000:0002:6400}}{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}Come no?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Come ho fatto a dimenticarmene?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ecco dove stavo andando!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Uau! Sei proprio brav{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} a indovinare!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Nessuno cava dai guai il prossimo
meglio di te!
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Grazie mille per avermi aiutato!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Non vedo l'ora di correre a fare
scorta di sciroppo d'acero!

ES:
{{TAG:0000:0002:6400}}{{TAG:0003:0016:}}{{TAG:0000:0002:6400}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}¡Los Países Bajos!{{TAG:0000:0002:6400}}{{TAG:0000:0002:6400}}{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:000D:}}¡Sí!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¿Cómo pude
olvidarlo?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Ahora lo veo claro!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000C:}}Grumete,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} empezaba a preocuparme.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
La cabeza{{TAG:0003:0028:}} me daba vueltas como
las aspas de un molino.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}¡Te lo agradezco!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ¡Muchas gracias!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
¡Me acordaré de ti cuando esté en
medio de un campo de tulipanes!

